{$kieran}: We just saved you from a “kidnapping”, risking our own lives along the way. Or are you too inebriated to recognize how close you were to being disappeared?
Drunk Guy: I'm a pacifist. I have a principled stance against violence of any kind. #line:0d8c706 
{$kieran}: How quaint. #line:04cdba9
